                "name": "Improper Limitation of a Pathname to a Restricted Directory ('Path Traversal')"
            },
            "notes": [
                {
                    "category": "summary",
                    "text": "NVIDIA Triton Inference Server for Linux contains a vulnerability where a user could cause files outside the model repository to be read, written to, or modified by providing a path in the model name to the Triton MLflow plugin. A successful exploit of this vulnerability might lead to denial of service and information disclosure.",
